# 统一 LF —— 与 zhishiku 仓库同一约定。
#
# 起因：本仓库 core.autocrlf=true 且原先没有 .gitattributes，
# 于是 Windows 检出为 CRLF、Mac 检出为 LF，两边整文件互相 diff（假 diff），
# 且 gofmt -l 会在 Windows 上把全部 .go 报成"未格式化"（实测 97 个文件），
# 噪声盖住真正的格式问题。
#
# git 索引里本来就是 LF（0 个 CRLF 条目），故加本文件不会引发批量变更，
# 只是让工作区与跨系统检出统一走 LF。

* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换（否则会损坏文件）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.rar binary
*.tar binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.node binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.mkv binary
*.safetensors binary
*.ckpt binary
*.pt binary
*.pth binary
*.onnx binary

# 供人工阅读/比对的大体积文本也按 LF，不参与自动判定
*.md text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
